window.products.push({"id":803040,"name":"Girls Party Drinking Games Cards - 52 Funny & Naughty Adult Drink If Cards for Birthday, Night Out, Bachelorette Party Supplies & Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CXCqm9tSL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Looking for perfect bachelorette party supplies? Already have bachelorette party decorations but need to spice things up with something interesting? Make your party fun and unforgettable, discover funny stories and reveal hidden secrets by playing this game with your girlfriends at a party or any outing. Our “Girls Card Drinking Game” contains 52 “Drink if...” cards with questions ranging from casual to more risqué. With 52 cards you get more options to choose which ones to play with. Made from a premium heavy card stock our cards are small enough to fit into any purse or a pocket and will not affect your outfit decision. Beautiful glamorous design and glossy finish make these cards stand out and look great at any Girl’s Night Out, Bachelorette, Birthday or Sorority party. Playing Suggestion: Place a pack of cards with the game title facing up in the middle of a table and have each guest take turns taking one card from the top and reading out loud the “Drink if…” statement. Whoever is guilty of that statement must take a drink. Our “Drinking Game” pack includes a “Wildcard”; if it’s played - everyone must drink! Some statements only affect the reader so make sure everyone takes turns. We suggest shuffling the cards prior to playing, but if you want to be devious and plant specific questions in order - that’s up to you. Sample Drink If statements: ❥ Drink If you’ve been abroad ❥ Drink If you have a tattoo ❥ Drink if you’re wearing a dress ❥ Drink if you’ve texted in the last 15 minutes ❥ Drink if you’ve kissed a girl ❥ Drink if you’ve ever sunbathed nude And much more… These games have been designed, printed and packaged in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CXCqm9tSL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Party Profi","source_asin":"B0781ZTMBT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-803040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0781ZTMBT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0781ZTMBT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":803041,"name":"JY Fit All Heated Throw Blanket - Soft Velvet Christmas Throw Blanket,6 Heat Settings, 50x60inches Cozy Throw Blanket,4 Time Settings,2 Hours Timer Au","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hW+neL5TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Comfortable Features : 6 temperature levels from 104‘ F to 140'F provide varied heating preference to satisfy different needs on temperature to throw blanket. 4 time settings of 0.5h, 1h, 1.5h, 2h for multiple timing selection. Ideally fit for both day and night. High Quality Fabric : 1.5mm length super cozy velvet blue throw blanket offers soft, light and comfortable touch feeling. Washable fabric feature makes the house chore no longer an issue and also makes this electric throw heated blanket not a normal heated blanket but an life essential.s Energy Saving : 0.15KWH per hour usage ultimately save your energy bill. This electric blanket is a perfect Christmas throw blanket gift for the season. Safety Warranty : Heated throw blanket electric with FCC , CE and RoHs certified. PTC/NTC heating wire provide dual protection and 2 hours overheating auto shut off guarantee the safe use of the blanket. Plug in the cord first before connect the power. Easy Care : Disconnect the controller from power cables and place the blanket in the washer. Using cold or lukewarm water is preferred for better care to the heated throw. Completely dry before connect the power. Multiple folding layers when heating are not recommended. Do not dry clean the blanket. Power off when overheating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hW+neL5TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JY FITALL","source_asin":"B0BV9B112C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-803041","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV9B112C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV9B112C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
