window.products.push({"id":803189,"name":"WindStream 14 inch Super High Velocity / Floor Fan, Heavy Duty, All Steel Safety Grill and Metal Blade, 140 watt motor on high = 3,884 cubic feet per ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710wCa4MXhL._AC_SL1220_.jpg","description":"This 14 inch High Velocity Fan has a powerful 140 watt motor in it and it moves 3,884 cubic feet of air per minute. Some companies put small 45 watt motors in their fans and move very little air. This UL fan is high quality and is the fan you need if you want to move a lot of air. Strong all steel construction with metal blades and a real chrome finish. 3 prong plug. UL Listed. - Using the Bernoulli Principal by putting this fan 3 to 4 feet back from a window on a sturdy table would yield an effective cubic feet per minute of over 10,000 cubic feet per minute. This would make a great whole house fan. - - - - - - - - 1 year factory warranty - - - - - - - The WindStream fan factory has been making fans for many top brand name companies for over 30 years. We created this line to have better quality, thicker plastic and bigger motors than typical fans. These fans are the best value we could make in this product category; these are not the cheap paper-thin plastic fans or thin wire fans with tiny motors made by some other factories. WindStream's bigger motors mean they move more air, yet they still cost less than other fans of lower quality. Today many companies are all about how cheap they can make a fan, we are all about how well we can make one.-------Hint: When comparing similar items; check the product weight, it will tell you how much material is used in the construction, a very lite product is likely cheap and flimsy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710wCa4MXhL._AC_SL1220_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dr.fasting","source_asin":"B007SORZM2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-803189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007SORZM2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007SORZM2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":803190,"name":"Paper Towel Holder Stand, Countertop Paper Towel Roll Dispenser Holders with Cube Base, Tissue Countertop Filled with Sparkly Crystal Crushed Diamond ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wsCfimP5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bling Crystal Holder: This stand up towel holder is made of crystal，the crystals sparkle like crazy and it’s so glamorous. The sparkly bits capture light nicely and lighten up wherever it is placed. Adds glamour and bling to decor and that pizzazz to our kitchen. Suitable for any style. Steady Paper Towel Holder Stand: The glass mirror surfaces square base has enough weight in base to stay so it remains upright whether used for paper towels or some other items. Paper towels can be easily pulled and torn away as needed. This paper towel holder is weighted enough to make a one hand tear possible. Perfect for who do things usually with one hand. Easy to Load & Use: This paper towel dispenser is easy to use and to refill.You can easily unscrew the top roller and then slide paper towel roll onto the spine of then once you pull out the piece of paper towel you want, give a firm drag from the top down to tear the sheet away. Fits the large rolls and the regular sizes without any issues. Easy to Put Together: The tissue holder is very easy to assemble, only need to screw the pole into the bottom and screw the top of the crystal into the pole without any tools. It is also easy to lift the towel rack to anywhere by using the knob on top. We can move it from kitchen to picnic table. This is a supreme towel rack for your kitchen. Multifunction:The countertop paper towel holder Looks lovely on the kitchen counter. The towel rack is great and does not take up too much counter space. Of course, in addition to holding paper towels, we can also use it to hold plastic wrap, tape, etc., to keep our desktop clean and orderly. Material: Crystal Easy to Install Easy to Clean Use as toilet paper holder, stretch film holder,scrunchie holder Occasion: Kitchen, living room, bedroom, dressing table, etc. anywhere you want to use it","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wsCfimP5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOPSKY","source_asin":"B09PGZXSBG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-803190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PGZXSBG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PGZXSBG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
