window.products.push({"id":803256,"name":"Stainless Steel Replacement Spigot for Beverage Dispenser with Screen Filter - Ice Tea, Kombucha, Lemonade - Also works with Ceramic Porcelain Crock a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K2UzR7hCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your supreme quality polished stainless steel beverage dispenser replacement spigot with screen will filter tea leaves and other particulates. The Stainless Spigot will serve as the perfect replacement for that cheap and easily breakable leaky plastic spigot that came with your ice tea, lemonade, or other beverage dispenser or most of the water containers sold today. After you easily install your stainless spigot your guests will see elegance and class while you dispense your favorite cold ice beverage. The look, style and solid heavy feel assures you of the top quality grade of our spigots. Made to last for life! Material: Your new spigot is made of 304 Polished Food-grade and Lead-free, BPA free Stainless Steel. Enjoy this easy to use and easy to install spigot for years. Be sure to think of your family and friends who may also have a cheap plastic spigot for their drink dispensers. This spigot would brighten their day and they will thank you for years to come. Installation and Safety Instructions: CAUTION: METAL EDGE OF GASKET MAY BE SHARP. HANDLE WITH CARE AND WEAR PROTECTIVE GLOVES WHILE INSTALLING GASKETS! Wash spigot with warm soapy water and rinse well. Peel thin plastic cover from metal gasket covers. Place one metal gasket cover and one silicon gasket over threaded portion of spigot so that the silicone gasket fits inside of metal gasket cover. Insert threaded end of spigot into opening of beverage dispenser. Push 2nd silicone gasket and metal gasket cover over threaded portion until it seats with 2nd silicone gasket. Screw nut onto the threaded stem until it fits against metal gasket cover. To use enclosed screen simply press it onto the end of the threaded stem until it tightly seals. You are ready to use your new Stainless Spigot!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K2UzR7hCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEKBOK","source_asin":"B074L5PRFS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-803256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074L5PRFS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074L5PRFS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
