window.products.push({"id":803455,"name":"Sorbus 4 Level Shoe Rack Blue, Blue, 20\"x 7.5\"x 22\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+9MHPZsfL._AC_SL1258_.jpg","description":"Are your children shoes scattered all around your house or thrown in their closet without regard? Dont stress, make getting ready effortless and hasty with Sorbus Kids Shoe Rack Junior Organizer Storage! This amazing shoe rack stores 8 to 12 pairs of shoes to preserve their shape and conserve limited closet space. It also allows your shoes to air out when not being worn. Using this organizer is a great way to keep your footwear open, fresh and safe from falling over other valuable items in your closet. Storing shoes in the best possible way like this will give them a longer, wearable life span. It is the ultimate accessory for a children room to encourage them to tidy up their shoes. It can also be used in the entryway of your home to hold your children shoes and their friends shoes so they don't track mud around the house! The rack is constructed of durable, high-quality plastic and metal for lasting quality. It can be easily assembled and requires no tools. The sturdy frame is attractive and accents any space. It is extremely lightweight and easy to move when cleaning the dirt underneath the rack. This shoe rack can be used on shoes or short boots of varying children sizes. Need more footwear storage? No problem! Every additional shoe rack (same item) can be easily added to store and display as many shoes as you want. It is the perfect solution to children's shoe organizing troubles by keeping them accessible and in one convenient place. This floor rack makes it easy to maximize your closet space without taking up limited shelf space. It is ideal for children's bedrooms, nurseries, hallways, and entrance ways. The shoe rack holds 8 to 12 pairs of shoes making it great for one or more kids! Having this rack keeps your children's shoes coordinated, easily accessible, and in great condition. What more could you ask for! This is also a great gift for any family with kids! Shoe rack measures approximately 20x 7.5x 22 when assembled.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+9MHPZsfL._AC_SL1258_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sorbus","source_asin":"B01C8ZT1Q8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-803455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01C8ZT1Q8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01C8ZT1Q8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
