window.products.push({"id":803569,"name":"ZAMAT Extra Thick Mattress Topper Cal King, 400TC 100% Organic Cotton Cooling Mattress Pad Cover, Plush Quilted Pillow Top with 950gsm Down Alternativ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"50% EXTRA THICK & UNBEATABLE SOFT: Couldn't sleep last night? Eager to soften your Bed? Lucky for you! Try using ZAMAT plush pillow-top mattress topper! Overfilled with 950gsm down-alternative fill, it's 50% thicker than a normal mattress pad offering the comfort of the cloud-like feel. Gusset-baffle box design keeps fill in place, helping distribute body weight evenly. A good mattress reviver to add extra cushioning and enchance the comfort level! Back pain will be a thing of the past! COOLING & BREATHABLE & SKIN-FRIENDLY: Whether you're a allergic suffers or a hot sleeper, you would definitely like this mattress cover. It's breathable, cooling to touch, chemical odor-free and hypoallergenic because of the 400TC organic cotton sateen shell and hollow microfiber down fill. Stay perfectly cool & comfortably warm with optimal temperature control. Say goodbye to sweat or stuffy noses caused by memory foam mattress or feather down fill bed pad ! Have a restful sleep all the night! DEEP POCKET & STURDY STITCHED SEAM: The elastic skirt fitted deep pocket easily fits mattresse up to 21\" without sliding around and curling up. No matter how you toss on the bed, our pad will keep neat all the night. Good tensile strength holds the stitched seam securely during machine wash. Don't worry about tearing and the fill poke out of the fabric. Bed topper is available in Twin: 39\"x 75\"+18\" Twin XL: 39\"x 80\"+18\" Full: 54\" x 75\"+18\" Queen: 60\"x80\"+18\" King: 78\"x 80\"+18\" CK: 72\"x 84\"+18“ MACHINE WASHABLE & EASY CARE: ZAMAT mattress protector is thicker enough to protect mattress from stains and spill. Also, it's super easy to wash and care. Just wash in cold water on gentle cycle. Low heat tumble dry. Don't bleach or iron. Compared with down fill, this microfiber fill has time-tested bounce and retains shape after consistent wash. You can enjoy its serving life more than 5 years. How cost-effective it is! Finally, it's lightweight and foldable, easy to storage and transport! LUXURIOUS SLEEP & 100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION: Thousands of customers get a better night's sleep after using our mattress topper. We offer, not 30-day, but a 90-day hassle-free return guaranttee. Don't hesitate to contact us through order detail page - sold by - contact seller. It's packaged in a vacuum bag, please put it in dryer for 20 min on low heat/air dry or lay it in the sun for few hours. If it leaves no free movement in the washer/dryer, please use large capacity commercial washer/dryer..950 gsm Microfiber Down Alternative Fill.400 TC 100% Organic Cotton Top","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZAMAT","source_asin":"B08MF2YBP4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-803569","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MF2YBP4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MF2YBP4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
