window.products.push({"id":803823,"name":"TPAP001 H13 True HEPA Replacement Filter, Compatible with TOPPIN TPAP001 Comfy Air C2 Air Purifier, 4-in-1 HEPA Air Filter, Part # TPFF001, 2 Pack【Not","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812OrdSoF2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍀PERFECT FIT: The premium TPAP001 replacement filter is fully compatible with TOPPIN TPAP001 Air Puri-fier Comfy Air C2. Compared to Part # TPFF001. NOTE: Not Fit for Kokofit KJ510B Air Purifiers. Please check your puri-fier model before making an order. 🍀EXCELLENT FILTRATION: Our compatible TOPPIN air puri-fier replacement filter combined with 360 degree fully-sealed efficient filter system, contains 2 packs 3-in-1 H13 True HEPA Filter Replacement, including Nylon Pre-Filter, H13 Grade True HEPA Filter, and High-Efficiency Activated Carbon Filter, creating fresh and purified air for you and your family. 🍀3-STAGE ADVANCED FILTRATION: The H13 Grade True HEPA Filter of tpap001 replacement filter is capable of attaching 99.7% of all particles as small as 0.3 microns in diameter; Nylon Pre-filter collect larger particles in the air like dust, hairs, pet fur, lint, and prolongs the life of HEPA filter; High-Efficiency Activated Carbon Filter take in household odors from pets, cooking, smoke, wildfire, and VOC’s. 🍀EASY INSTALLATION: Easy to replace the TPAP001 air filter: Simply take out the old filter from your TPAP001 Comfy Air C2 air puri-fier and install our new TPAP001 filter in. Please take off plastic bag of new filter before using. After replacement, press and hold the Filter button 5s until a beep is heard to reset. To keep your Air Puri-fier runs at optimal performance, it is recommended to replace your TPAP001 filter at least once each 3 to 6 months.(depending upon your usage and environment) 🍀SUPER CRAFT: Our TPAP001 replacement filter is made of high quality non-woven fabric and activated carbon, both adopt advanced lower energy consumption and lower density structure technology verified by the manufacturer, with higher efficiency and less pressure to ensure maximum filtration. And the upgraded technology which used in H13 true hepa filter ensures energy saving and a longer service life. 🍀BUY WITH CONFIDENCE: Package includes 2 x TPAP001 True HEPA Replacement Filter. They are an efficient investment for your air puri-fier. After testing, our tpap001 air filter replacement has the same quality as original, please don’t worry and buy it with confidence. We value customer's using experience, if you have any problems during use time, please contact us through our Amazon home page. We will try our best to solve your problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812OrdSoF2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lacvik","source_asin":"B0BNZZV3Q6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-803823","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNZZV3Q6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNZZV3Q6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
