window.products.push({"id":803851,"name":"Bargoose Home Textiles | Zippered Mattress or Box Spring Cover | Bed Bug, Dust Mite Proof | Lab Tested & Certified | Hypoallergenic, Waterproof & Flam","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K5+PF8rlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMPLETE MATTRESS PROTECTION: Whether you are protecting your mattress or boxspring from bedwetting accidents or infestations, this protective cover helps preserve the life of your mattress. Protect your investment by using protective bedding to extend the life of your mattress. Our waterproof covers are zippered overlays for full, all-around protection. ULTIMATE SOLUTION: Once an infestation occurs, it's extremely difficult to control. Our mattress cover helps prevent this with our patented tape closure that fits securely over the rust-proof zipper end, forming a complete seal that prevents unwanted visitors from getting in or out. CERTIFIED & LAB TESTED: Bargoose Home Textile mattress and boxspring encasements are the best way to protect against infestations. They are also waterproof to help safeguard against spills, stains, moisture and sweat. Our covers are scientifically proven to effectively eradicate unwanted guests, and can be used for both active outbreaks and prevention. FLAME RETARDANT: Stretch polyester knit fabric with urethane allows air to pass through for a cool and comfortable sleep, while also providing an effective barrier against unwanted visitor. This economical, zippered mattress and boxspring cover is flame retardant and waterproof and will extend the life of your mattress and boxspring. THE PERFECT FIT: The style and construction of our overlays give you the tight, snug feeling of a traditional fitted cover with the added advantage of full 360 protection that comes from a true zippered encasement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K5+PF8rlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BARGOOSE HOME TEXTILES, INC.","source_asin":"B07CBQ83B6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-803851","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CBQ83B6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CBQ83B6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
