window.products.push({"id":803853,"name":"Teabloom Large Multi-Brew Glass Teapot + Kettle + Pitcher (68 OZ / 2.0 L / 8 CUPS) – Brew and Serve Hot Tea, Iced Tea, Cold Brew Tea and Fruit Infused","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7125HPKqwIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE ONE-STOP ALL-BEVERAGE MAKER. Now you can prepare, serve and store all your favorite beverages in the same beautiful glass pitcher. Custom-brew hot tea, iced tea, cold-brew tea, fruit-infused water, and more. Perfect for entertaining, gift-giving, and everyday use. TEAPOT FUNCTIONALITY WITH ADDED CONVENIENCE. Large capacity carafe holds 8-10 cups (2.0 L) or 68 OZ. Use with loose-leaf tea, tea bags, and Teabloom’s blooming tea varieties. And you can leave the filter and lid in place for pouring – simply brew, pour, and enjoy. INNOVATIVE DESIGN FOR MORE VERSATILITY. The Pitcher’s superfine stainless-steel filter contains the smallest tea leaves while allowing full flavor development. The extra-deep removable infuser basket also lets you brew a full pitcher or just a few cups. MULTI-BREW FILTER LID. The filter lid may be used with or without the filter basket inside the glass flask. Tannin-free teas, like herbal blends, can be placed directly in the glass flask as they are automatically filtered off when you pour the beverage. PRACTICAL DETAILS MAKE THE DIFFERENCE. Handcrafted of premium quality, durable borosilicate glass with non-drip spout and large, comfortable handle. Crystal-clear glass and stainless-steel parts never absorb flavors or odors. Dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7125HPKqwIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Teabloom","source_asin":"B09GLNCHBD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-803853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GLNCHBD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GLNCHBD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
