window.products.push({"id":803946,"name":"TOPCHASE Shower Caddy Bathroom Shower Organizer, Black Adhesive Shower Shelves for Inside Shower, 2 Pack Stainless Steel Shower Organization Basket Wi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+bIN7a-sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Larger Size & 2 Pack: The bathroom shower shelf measures 12.2” long and 5.1” wide, bigger than most shower shelves on the market. The towel bar provides enough space to spread towels to dry, the soap holder for your soap and sponge, and hooks to hang shower loofahs, razor, etc. Enough to hold your shower necessities but won't take too much space, especially suitable for students, tenants, two person families, etc. Adhesive Shower Caddies & 30LBS: Use waterproof strong adhesives to install, no drilling, no damage to the wall. The upgraded adhesives are with larger waterproof sticker and stronger hooks, provide better stickiness, more durable. Tested and verified the shower caddy affords up to 30LBS. No worry about falling. (Note: to ensure stronger stickiness, wait 24 hours after sticking to the wall). Traceless on the wall if removed. Upgraded Shower Wall Caddy: The fence of the adhesive shower caddy is widened to prevent bottles from falling and provide stronger support. The reinforced bottom and the binding design for the bottom lines provide more support as well, more durable & long-lasting. The denser lines of bottom make this shower caddy perfect to store tiny sample bottles without them falling through the grids. Rustproof & Drips Fast: Made of 304 stainless steel and adopted sandblasting technology on the surface to carry out secondary protection, this bathroom shower caddy set is waterproof, moisture-proof and rust free, won’t deform when bearing great weight, looks new after long-term use. Hollowed bottom, drips fast and is easy to dry without accumulating stains, keeps your stuffs tidy and clean. Multiple applications: This stainless steel shower caddy set is suitable for ceramic tile, marble, tempered glass, smooth solid wood wall, smooth solid metal and other smooth walls. They could be installed in bathroom, kitchen, bedroom, living room, dormitory, washbasin and other places, suitable for both corners and straight walls. Apartment essentials for first apartment! Worry-free Shopping Experience: You will get 1 shower caddy, 1 towel bar, 1 soap holder with 4 hooks, 3 adhesives (2 necessary and 1 spare). We value your shopping experience so much, if any problem about the shower caddy and soap holder or the adhesives, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+bIN7a-sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOPCHASE","source_asin":"B0B9NHRD9F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-803946","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9NHRD9F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9NHRD9F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
