window.products.push({"id":803997,"name":"ApexDesk 60\" Elite Height Adjustable Desk w/Cabinet Bundle (Black Desk/Black Cabinet)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":729.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61--kZKRAvS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Apex Desk Elite Series Height Adjustable Desk distinguishes itself in many ways and is a big bang for your hard-earned buck: >➢ Stability – The underframe is constructed with one-piece center beam for added stability. It is more stable than many desks that have a crossbar. >➢ Crossbar-Free – It allows more leg room and flexibility of adding an exercise bike/treadmill by some users. >➢ Ease of Assembly – Most users get it up and running in less than 45 minutes, thanks to the screw-less design that uses levers rather than screws to secure beam to the lifting columns. >➢ MDF Desktop – Most desks in our price range are constructed with low-grade particle board. Ours is made of MDF (medium density fiberboard) with anti-scratch, high-pressure laminate – a premium material used primarily in high-end furniture. >Featuring European design and engineering, the Elite Series Electric Height Adjustable Desk lets you transform seamlessly from a sitting to a standing position within a matter of seconds with a push of a button. >> Bundle Includes ApexDesk 3-Drawer Metal Mobile File Cabinet with Locking Keys >Sturdy and Durable – This steel-constructed 3-drawer filing cabinet has a sleek and modern feel, with round edges and smooth matte finish. Its compact design allows this drawer to fit under most office desks. >Spacious Storage – 2 upper drawers with one stationery tray to provide storage space for your small office essentials. Outer dims for each drawer is 13.6\"W x 17.7\"D x 5.1\"H. Overall Dimensions: 18.8\" L x 15.3\" W x 23.2\" H. >Versatile Bottom Drawer – Bottom-hanging file drawer comes with one removable hanging bar to accommodate different file sizes - Letter, A4 and Legal. Bottom drawer outer dims 12.8\"W x 17.7\"D x 9.4\"H. >Anti-Tilt Mechanism – Allows only one drawer to open at a time, preventing the cabinet from tipping over. >360° Swivel Casters – Easily moves across your room without damaging your floor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61--kZKRAvS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ApexDesk","source_asin":"B09LVVBN5C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-803997","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LVVBN5C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LVVBN5C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
